    "updated_at": "2023-05-03T17:36:27Z",
    "body": "Right, URLPattern is not very useful for filtering on specific query parameters because of the ordering issue.  We could enahance the API to better support this, but right now its perhaps more natural to use something like URLSearchParams.\r\n\r\nI think to solve this we would need to find a reasonable API shape and somehow prove out it would be effective with web developers.",
